39
00:01:37,538 --> 00:01:40,278
It is often launched on purpose, with music and

40
00:01:40,278 --> 00:01:40,638
movement.

41
00:01:41,218 --> 00:01:44,198
The person craves it, struggles to stop it, and

42
00:01:44,198 --> 00:01:48,038
lets it crowd out real life, work, relationships, and

43
00:01:48,038 --> 00:01:48,358
sleep.

44
00:01:48,918 --> 00:01:50,518
The idea has a short history.

45
00:01:50,958 --> 00:01:54,398
In 2002, Illy Summer names it after treating six

46
00:01:54,398 --> 00:01:54,958
patients.

47
00:01:55,538 --> 00:01:58,538
In 2011, a survey of 90 people calls it

48
