compulsive fantasy.

49
00:02:00,178 --> 00:02:03,858
In 2016 comes the first scale, tested in 45

50
00:02:03,858 --> 00:02:04,418
countries.

51
00:02:05,058 --> 00:02:08,538
In 2017, researchers propose formal criteria.

52
