And in 2025, 27 experts asked for it to

53
00:02:12,938 --> 00:02:15,378
be listed as a dissociative disorder.

54
00:02:16,098 --> 00:02:19,718
Summer, a psychologist in Israel, defined it as extensive

55
00:02:19,718 --> 00:02:24,778
fantasy activity that replaces human interaction or interferes with

56
00:02:24,778 --> 00:02:27,318
study, relationships, or work.

57
00:02:27,978 --> 00:02:30,638
He believed it grew from a normal childhood talent

58
00:02:30,638 --> 00:02:34,878
for imagination, which hard circumstances turned into a problem.

59
00:02:35,418 --> 00:02:39,698
In 2011, Bigelsohn and Shupak surveyed 90 self -identified

60
00:02:39,698 --> 00:02:43,298
