61
00:02:44,478 --> 00:02:47,298
79 % moved their bodies while fantasizing.

62
00:02:47,758 --> 00:02:50,278
The distress came from losing control of the urge,

63
00:02:50,598 --> 00:02:53,558
from fantasy getting in the way of real relationships

64
00:02:53,558 --> 00:02:56,058
and goals, and from intense shame.

65
00:02:56,618 --> 00:03:00,518
They estimated that fantasy filled about 56 % of

66
